title: "healthy-anchored-transfer: code, results and registered analysis rules for a benchmark of healthy-anchored alignment of plant-disease models across crops"
abstract: "Code, registered analysis rules and results for the benchmark 'Can Healthy Leaves Alone Transfer Plant Disease Models Across Crops? A Benchmark of Healthy-Anchored Alignment': a registered real-pair test on PlantWild v1 (primary) and a synthetic-world benchmark built from real image features (secondary)."
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
